    "norm": "Tests {@link CharSet#equals(Object)}. <p>Two CharSets are equal only when they are defined the same way. In particular the listed set \"abc\", the range \"a-c\" and the negated range \"^a-c\" all represent different definitions and are therefore never equal to each other, even though some describe overlapping characters.</p>"
